    "body": "Quick test - http://output.jsbin.com/wumiriw/quiet. `drawImage` appears to scale in a vector-friendly way. Makes sense to be consistent there. (Firefox fails to draw some of the circles due to [a known bug](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=700533)).\n",
