    "created_at": "2016-07-14T15:01:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-14T15:02:04Z",
    "body": "I am not sure that optimization needs to be in the spec. It's up to implementations to find efficient ways to produce results equivalent to those produced by the spec algorithm, and the algorithm in the spec should be the simplest and clearest expression of a means of obtaining the desired result.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
