    "created_at": "2016-07-14T15:12:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-14T15:15:37Z",
    "body": "Right now, the crop rect is in post-resize coordinates. Is that easier to reson about than specifying the crop in source image coordinates?\n",
