    "updated_at": "2016-07-14T15:21:10Z",
    "body": "FYI: The previous question is not rhetorical, I am really just asking asking which is more intuitive to use? \nThe other way I'd see this working is that we crop first then apply a transform that maps the crop rect to (0, 0, resizeWidth, resizeHeight)\n",
