    "created_at": "2016-07-14T15:38:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-14T15:39:10Z",
    "body": "Seems like consistency with `drawImage` would be best here.\n\nIn `drawImage`, `sx, sy, sw, sh` are in the coordinate space of the source image. In terms of coordinates it's \"crop, then resize\", but that isn't strictly the behaviour. See the final note in step 4 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#drawing-images:dom-context-2d-drawimage-4\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
