    "created_at": "2016-07-14T15:50:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-14T15:50:33Z",
    "body": "Yeah, drawImage is quite different. It works more like a rect-to-rect map. I don't think it's a good reference since the parameters are different. In the case of createImageBitmap we always generate an image that has its top left corner at (0,0).\n",
