    "updated_at": "2016-07-21T17:14:09Z",
    "body": "Yeah, it's just the rasterization stuff that remains. The algorithm takes bitmap data so I guess that suggests rasterization has already happened? Ideally rasterization shouldn't happen until after crop and resize.\n\nThere's also the question of the viewport size when determining which media queries to use, but this is also a source of inconsistency with `drawImage`. I'll create another issue for this.\n",
