    "created_at": "2018-02-28T17:02:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-28T17:02:49Z",
    "body": "Yeah, so I guess we should keep the algorithm for bitmaps as-is, as I did in the patch. And I guess we should add a test for the above without a copyrighted image.",
